    {
      "duration_ms": 9000,
      "caption": "epoll_wait returns only ready events, so cost tracks activity, not registered descriptors.",
      "narration": "epoll_wait just drains the ready list, so cost tracks the number of active sockets. You can pick level-triggered or edge-triggered delivery.",
